"></span>\n  </li>\n  \n  <li class=\"trace__row\" data-run=\"1\" data-run-no=\"2\" data-date=\"2025-10-09\" data-grade=\"B\">\n    <span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"warn\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"warn\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace__cell\" data-tone=\"untested\"></span><span class=\"trace_